t md:mx-0 text-3xl md:text-6xl xl:text-8xl uppercase mb-2">
        Official Merch</h2> <div class="text-content section-body max-w-lg"><p>We’ve teamed up with The Yetee to create an awesome collection of official merchandise for Darkest Dungeon. </p><p>Get tees, pins, posters and more!</p></div> <div class="flex items-center justify-center md:justify-start w-full mt-6 gap-3"><a href="https://theyetee.com/collections/darkest-dungeon" target="_blank" class="btn btn--primary btn btn--primary py-3 px-8 md:py-4 md:px-10 text-base md:text-xl"><span class="btn-text">Visit Store</span></a></div></div></div> <div class="section-bg"><div class="section-bg-wrapper container container--large"><picture class="picture"><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://img2.storyblok.com/fit-in/320x0/filters:format(webp)/f/127947/1920x1080/f161395b46/background-castle.jpg 320w, https://img2.storyblok.com/fit-in/640x0/filters:format(webp)/f/127947/1920x1080/f161395b46/background-castle.jpg 640w, https://img2.storyblok.com/fit-in/768x0/filters:format(webp)/f/127947/1920x1080/f161395b46/background-castle.jpg 768w, https://img2.storyblok.com/fit-in/1024x0/filters:format(webp)/f/127947/1920x1080/f161395b46/background-castle.jpg 1024w, https://img2.storyblok.com/fit-in/1280x0/filters:format(webp)/f/127947/1920x1080/f161395b46/background-castle.jpg 1280w, https://img2.storyblok.com/fit-in/1536x0/filters:format(webp)/f/127947/1920x1080/f161395b46/background-castle.jpg 1536w, https://img2.storyblok.com/fit-in/1536x0/filters:format(webp)/f/127947/1920x1080/f161395b46/background-castle.jpg 1536w" sizes="(max-width: 320px) 320px, (max-width: 640px) 640px, (max-width: 768px) 768px, (max-width: 1024px) 1024px, (max-width: 1280px) 1280px, (max-width: 1536px) 1536px, 1536px"> <img src="https://img2.storyblok.com/fit-in/1536x0/filters:format(jpeg)/f/127947/1920x1080/f161395b46/background-castle.jpg" srcset="https://img2.storyblok.com/fit-in/320x0/filters:format(jpeg)/f/127947/1920x1080/f161395b46/background-castle.jpg 320w, https://img2.storyblok.com/fit-in/640x0